                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "When I bought this game, it was with a couple of my friends, and we only bought it because it was on sale, and we thought it would be bad, but loading up the game, I slowly but surely got addicted, and within 2 (almost 3) hours, I reached level 11,000.\nThe game is very addicting, and really tenses you up, but I must say, the x-ray power up is disorienting, the camera angles are a little bit strange, and I'd love to see a first-person mode.\nBut other than those, it's very fun, and I'd love to see what this game is capable of!",
